Update: it turns out pandoc has a specific tag to deal with this exact problem,

--default-image-extension=EXTENSION

thus allowing to switch between different file formats for latex or html output, with image links intentionally lacking file extension. The question becomes, how do I tell knit() to avoid putting extensions to image files?

baptiste

